{"id": "63251", "title": "披著羊皮的狼", "author": "幽兰", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63251.htm", "intro": "霸道爱系列二：《披着羊皮的狼》\r\n\r\n属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／轻松\r\n\r\n他是披着羊皮的狼，她被他的温柔模样骗倒了，\r\n\r\n谁说看起来温柔的男人就很温柔？他根本就是彻头彻尾的色狼！\r\n\r\n什麽？她是他的玩具？她是人，不是玩具好不好！\r\n\r\n不要以为他是校长就得寸进尺", "base": "files/article/html/63/63251", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9360671.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9360673.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "9360675.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "9360678.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "9360679.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "9360681.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9360682.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "9360683.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9360684.html", "available": false}]}